# A constructor that calls a virtual/dynamic/override method of its OWN class
# dispatches to a descendant override before the descendant's fields are set.
# FIRE: DoInit (virtual, 45), Self.DoDyn (dynamic, 46), DoWork (virtual, 47),
#       DoInit (override, 63 -- in TDerived.Create).
# NOT:  inherited Create (44, 62 -- static ancestor call), DoPlain (48 -- not
#       virtual), DoInit at 53 (inside a normal method, not a constructor).
virtual-method-in-constructor 45
virtual-method-in-constructor 46
virtual-method-in-constructor 47
virtual-method-in-constructor 63
!virtual-method-in-constructor 44
!virtual-method-in-constructor 48
!virtual-method-in-constructor 53
!virtual-method-in-constructor 62
